- u_gtdbtk removes the canary and terminates GTDB-Tk if interrupted or if GTDB-Tk fails, and reclaims canaries left by dead processes on the same host
- u_gtdbtk combines GTDB-Tk results only once all batches are done, and reports how many batches are done, running (per host), and remaining
- genome batch files are created atomically so instances started together do not conflict

